# Anthropic-family dispatch substrate

**House rule (operator 2026-10-18):** the 2026-07-18 standing prohibition is retired. Anthropic API credits are funded. This rule names which wire to pick, not a ban.

## Defaults (binding)

| Path | Default |
|---|---|
| `model=anthropic/*` on `team_dispatch` / Stargate Anthropic Messages API | **Admitted** when `credit_gate_healthy`. Standard (`config/anthropic_credit.yaml`): `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5`, `anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5`. High-cost: `anthropic/claude-opus-5-5`, `anthropic/claude-fable-5-1` need `cost_intent=deliberate_high_cost` plus a non-empty reason. Do not refuse a named `anthropic/*` call as prohibited. |
| `model=cursor/*` on `seat=cursor-sdk` | In use: `cursor/grok-4.7`, `cursor/composer-2.5`. `cursor/claude-*` only when the operator names it available (`consult-routing` § Cursor-sdk generate shape). |
| Anthropic-family consult (Opus / Sonnet / web-anthropic product) | **web-anthropic-cdp remains the default judgment wire** — cortex-packaged hot paths (`cortex://`) for fewer tool calls; `workspaces://` is readable (name it when exploration is encouraged); ¬ GitHub connector browse. API is the metered alternative, not a replacement for every consult. |
| Codebase must be navigable on the executor | **`cursor/grok-4.7`** (cursor-sdk) |

**Fable:** standing consult default is the CDP / web-anthropic product picker. `anthropic/claude-fable-5-1` is the high-cost API path (credit gate + `deliberate_high_cost`). Operator-named `cursor/claude-fable-5{,-1}` follows `consult-routing` § Cursor-sdk generate shape.

## Anti-patterns

| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| “Opus High” → always `model=anthropic/claude-opus-5-5` | Default consult stays `cdp/opus-5.5`. Use API Opus when the leg is metered on purpose, with `deliberate_high_cost` and a reason. |
| Tell the operator or a peer seat that `anthropic/*` is prohibited | Credits are funded. Admit when the credit gate allows the model. |
| Cancel / re-route without operator bind when substrate was wrong | Ask substrate; ¬ silent cancel of a live dispatch |

## Stargate gate

`anthropic_override_gate` admits explicit `model=anthropic/*` when the credit gate is healthy and the id is a standard model, or when `cost_intent=deliberate_high_cost` plus a reason, an in-family profile, or a review-child spawn. **Passing that gate is permission.** A credit-unhealthy or non-standard id without `deliberate_high_cost` still 422s. That 422 is the gate, not a house-rule ban to lecture.

